  ('5mm x 75mm Hex Shaft - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1347-PK4', '5mm Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV DUO System. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. REV shafts are made out of strong, corrosion resistant stainless steel. Specifications Material: Stainless Steel (SUS303) OD: 5mm Hex Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1347-PK4 5mm x…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-41-1347-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/723/images/2895/REV-41-0000-5mm-Hex-Shafts-Hero-FINAL__26864.1654542780.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('5mm x 90mm Hex Shaft - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1348-PK4', '5mm Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV DUO System. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. REV shafts are made out of strong, corrosion resistant stainless steel. Specifications Material: Stainless Steel (SUS303) OD: 5mm Hex Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1347-PK4 5mm x…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-41-1348-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/723/images/2895/REV-41-0000-5mm-Hex-Shafts-Hero-FINAL__26864.1654542780.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('5mm x 135mm Hex Shaft - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1349-PK4', '5mm Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV DUO System. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. REV shafts are made out of strong, corrosion resistant stainless steel. Specifications Material: Stainless Steel (SUS303) OD: 5mm Hex Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1347-PK4 5mm x…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-41-1349-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/723/images/2895/REV-41-0000-5mm-Hex-Shafts-Hero-FINAL__26864.1654542780.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('60mm Traction Wheel - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1350-PK4', 'DUO Traction Wheels are compatible with the REV DUO System and fit on a 5mm hex shaft. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. DUO Traction Wheels 60mm in diameter and larger have a hole pattern on an 8mm pitch enabling easy mounting directly to DUO Extrusion, DUO Brackets, and other 8mm pitch systems. All DUO motion products have a uniform 15mm width to make quick design swaps fast and easy. Specifications Hub…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-Traction-Wheels/?sku=REV-41-1350-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/720/images/2887/REV-41-0000-DUO-Traction-Wheel--Hero-FINAL__46920.1654284261.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('30mm Traction Wheel - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1353-PK4', 'DUO Traction Wheels are compatible with the REV DUO System and fit on a 5mm hex shaft. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. DUO Traction Wheels 60mm in diameter and larger have a hole pattern on an 8mm pitch enabling easy mounting directly to DUO Extrusion, DUO Brackets, and other 8mm pitch systems. All DUO motion products have a uniform 15mm width to make quick design swaps fast and easy. Specifications Hub…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-Traction-Wheels/?sku=REV-41-1353-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/720/images/2887/REV-41-0000-DUO-Traction-Wheel--Hero-FINAL__46920.1654284261.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('90mm Traction Wheel - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1354-PK2', 'DUO Traction Wheels are compatible with the REV DUO System and fit on a 5mm hex shaft. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. DUO Traction Wheels 60mm in diameter and larger have a hole pattern on an 8mm pitch enabling easy mounting directly to DUO Extrusion, DUO Brackets, and other 8mm pitch systems. All DUO motion products have a uniform 15mm width to make quick design swaps fast and easy. Specifications Hub…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-Traction-Wheels/?sku=REV-41-1354-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/720/images/2887/REV-41-0000-DUO-Traction-Wheel--Hero-FINAL__46920.1654284261.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('M3 x 8mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1359-PK100', 'M3 Hex Cap Screws are compatible with the REV DUO System. Length measured from tip to underside of hex cap. Specifications Material: Corrosion Resistant Zinc Plated Steel Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Head Dimensions: 5.5mm Hex Width, 2mm Height Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Tips & Tricks for Building with the DUO Build System Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1713-PK100 M3 x 6mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack STEP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Hex-Cap-Screws/?sku=REV-41-1359-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/722/images/2894/M3x10mm_Hex_Cap_Screws_Pack_Photo_From_Bundle_Shot__18790.1614451259.1280.1280__98672.1654289750.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('M3 x 16mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1360-PK100', 'M3 Hex Cap Screws are compatible with the REV DUO System. Length measured from tip to underside of hex cap. Specifications Material: Corrosion Resistant Zinc Plated Steel Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Head Dimensions: 5.5mm Hex Width, 2mm Height Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Tips & Tricks for Building with the DUO Build System Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1713-PK100 M3 x 6mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack STEP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Hex-Cap-Screws/?sku=REV-41-1360-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/722/images/2894/M3x10mm_Hex_Cap_Screws_Pack_Photo_From_Bundle_Shot__18790.1614451259.1280.1280__98672.1654289750.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('M3 Nyloc Nuts - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1361-PK100', 'M3 Nyloc Nuts (REV-41-1361-PK100) are zinc plated steel nuts compatible with all REV M3 screws or bolts. Contains a nylon insert which increases grip on screw, reducing the chance of the nut loosening over time. Does NOT fit in the channel of our REV DUO 15mm Extrusion System. M3 Nuts (REV-41-1126-PK100) Zinc plated steel nuts compatible with all REV DUO M3 screws or bolts. This is a plain nut which does NOT contains a nylon insert. Specifications Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Material: Corrosion…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Nuts/?sku=REV-41-1361-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/966/images/3808/REV-41-1126-1361_M3Nuts_FAMILY_FINAL__12437.1778681422.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('5mm x 400mm Hex Shaft - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1362-PK4', '5mm Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV DUO System. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. REV shafts are made out of strong, corrosion resistant stainless steel. Specifications Material: Stainless Steel (SUS303) OD: 5mm Hex Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1347-PK4 5mm x…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-41-1362-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/723/images/2895/REV-41-0000-5mm-Hex-Shafts-Hero-FINAL__26864.1654542780.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Servo Gear Adapter - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1364-PK4', 'This Servo Gear Adapter is a 15 Tooth Plastic Gear that attaches to any 25T output servo including the Smart Robot Servo. Warning: Gears from other building systems may have a very similar tooth profile but are not an exact match. It may be possible to use the two gears systems together successfully in some situations, but it is not recommended. Specifications Module: 0.75 Pressure Angle: 20° Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Thickness: 10mm Servo Spline: 25T Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME PRODUCT…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1364-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/191/images/2491/REV-41-1364-render-downloadedfrombigcommerce-edit__22374.1640721917.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Hubs & Adapters', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Roller Chain - 10 ft', 'REV-41-1365', 'This #25 roller chain is designed for use with #25 sprockets. Each package includes 1 connecting link, and additional links are available separately in the #25 Connecting Links – 5 Pack. For custom chain lengths, we recommend the REV #25 Chain Tool, a custom-designed tool that allows teams to easily break and re-assemble #25 chain. Specifications Material: Steel Size: #25 Pitch: 0.25in', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1365/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/203/images/749/REV-41-1365-1__17582.1472785904.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Connecting Links - 5 Pack', 'REV-41-1366-PK5', 'Connecting link for #25 chain. Use a connecting link to connect two ends of chain to create a loop. Specifications Material: Steel Size: #25 Pitch: 0.25in CAD & Drawings REV-41-1366 STEP File REV-41-1366 Onshape', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1366-pk5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/202/images/748/REV-41-1366-1__24852.1615482297.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('Small Pulley Bearings - 10 Pack', 'REV-41-1368-PK10', 'These v-groove bearing pulleys fit on an M3 x 16mm Hex Cap Screw and can be mounted directly onto extrusion. Use with 15mm Linear Motion Kits and a high tensile strength no-stretch string, such as kevlar string or spectra fishing line, to create an elevator. Product Options Specifications Material: High Carbon Steel ID: 3mm OD: 12mm Width: 4mm V-groove Width: 2.5mm V-groove Depth: 1mm Documentation DUO Build System Guide Notes Based on customer feedback, we have changed suppliers of this…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1368-pk10/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/205/images/751/REV-41-1368-1__56336.1472785907.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('Hook and Loop Fastener - 13.5mm x 2m', 'REV-41-1373', 'Double-sided hook and loop tape allows you to cut to desired custom lengths. Reusable, secure hold. Specifications 13.5mm width x 2m length', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1373/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/231/images/817/Velcro_REV-41-1373_1__79285.1615482398.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('5.5mm Combination Wrench', 'REV-41-1374', 'The 12-point combination wrench (REV-41-1374) is for use with M3 hardware. The 12-point ratcheting combination wrench (REV-49-1711) is perfect for fitting into those small spaces on your robot. For use with M3 hardware. Specifications Chrome vanadium steel 5.5mm 15° angled ring head (REV-41-1374)', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5.5mm-Wrenches?sku=REV-41-1374', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/965/images/3807/REV-49-1711-1374_Wrenches_FAMILY_FINAL__94587.1778602932.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 150mm - 45° Ends - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1430-PK2', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1430-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 225mm - 90° Ends - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1431-PK2', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1431-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 420mm - 90° Ends - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1432-PK4', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1432-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1433-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1433-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal 12mm Ball Bearing Mount V2 - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1452-PK4', 'This metal ball bearing mount bracket is used with the REV DUO System 15mm Extrusion. Version 2 brackets offer many improvements over our previous metal brackets, including holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. This bracket is used to mount 12mm OD bearings to the REV DUO 15mm Extrusion. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Thickness: 3.2mm Mounting Holes: 3.4mm diameter on 8mm grid Documentation DUO Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-41-1452 STEP File…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1452-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/304/images/1071/REV-41-1452-1__96224.1513387775.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
  ('Punch Tube - 1m', 'REV-41-1453', 'The REV Punch Tube is designed to enable teams to rapidly prototype ideas and build robots without some of the constraints generally associated with extrusion based construction. When paired with our Metric Step Drill (REV-49-1455) and 1/8in or 3.2mm pop-rivets, the Punch Tube is fast to build with as well as being extremely robust. Two of the four sides feature a slot that is compatible with the alignment ribs on our 15mm Plastic Brackets. All four sides feature a groove down the center that…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1453/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/316/images/1084/REV-41-1453-1__13647.1513383650.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Offset Servo Bracket V2 - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1475-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1475-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal 30 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1476-PK8', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Thickness: 2mm Mounting Holes: 3.4mm Diameter on 8mm Grid Documentation BuildingGuide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1476-PK8 15mm Metal 30 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-41-1477-PK8 15mm Metal 45 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1476-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/710/images/2909/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalBrackets-Hero-final__04568.1655156659.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
