  ('15mm Metal 60 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1478-PK8', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Thickness: 2mm Mounting Holes: 3.4mm Diameter on 8mm Grid Documentation BuildingGuide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1476-PK8 15mm Metal 30 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-41-1477-PK8 15mm Metal 45 Degree Bracket V2 - 8 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1478-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/710/images/2909/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalBrackets-Hero-final__04568.1655156659.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
