  ('M3 Standoff - 420mm - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1495-PK4', 'M3 standoffs are compatible with the REV DUO System and are perfect for raising one(7) assembly above another or as linkages when paired with male ball joint rod ends (REV-49-1561). Specifications Material: 6063 Black Anodized Aluminum Thread Depth: 10mm Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Flat to Flat Dimension: 5.5mm Hex Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1489-PK4 M3 Standoff - 15mm - 4 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-41-1490-PK4 M3 Standoff - 25mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Standoffs/?sku=REV-41-1495-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/707/images/2862/REV-41-1489-M3_Standoff-Hero-FINAL__97606.1653061938.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('22 Tooth Plastic Right Angle Rack Gear - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1503-PK8', 'Make driving linear motion easy with the 22 Tooth Plastic Right Angle Rack Gear. Mount the rack gear to a slot in either the REV DUO Extrusion or REV DUO Channel while using any of the REV DUO Plastic Gears to drive motion. Specifications Module: 0.75 Material: Nylon PA6 CAD & Drawings REV-41-1503 STEP File REV-41-1503 Onshape REV-41-1503 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1503/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/401/images/2370/REV-41-1503-22ToothPlasticRightAngleGear-AliciaFINAL__86975.1636583832.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
  ('5mm Hex to 8mm Round Bearing Insert - 20 Pack', 'REV-41-1528-PK20', 'The 5mm Hex to 8mm Round Bearing Insert, when paired with the 8mm x 12mm x 3.5mm Flanged Bearing (REV-49-1559), allows you to support 5mm hex shaft with a robust low friction bearing. It includes a pair of locking tabs that secure the insert to the bearing. Specifications Material: Nylon PA6 Bore: 5mm Hex OD: 8mm Round Supported Bearing Width: 3.5mm Documentation DUO Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-41-1528 STEP File REV-41-1528 Onshape REV-41-1528 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1528-pk20/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/297/images/1057/REV-41-1528-1__88373.1614451258.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('Aluminum Servo Shaft Adapter', 'REV-41-1558', 'This Servo Shaft Adapter makes it possible to drive a 5mm hex shaft with any 25T output servo including the Smart Robot Servo. The adapter attaches to the servo spline like any common servo horn and accepts a 5mm hex shaft on the opposite end. This product is the same as the plastic version, but can carry quite a bit more load. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Servo Spline Type: 25T ID: 5mm hex Inside Hex Depth: 11mm CAD & Drawings REV-41-1558 STEP File REV-41-1558 Onshape REV-41-1558…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1558/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/300/images/2057/REV-41-1558-Aluminum-Servo-Shaft-Adapter-2-FINAL__53014.1620421929.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Hubs & Adapters', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Corner Cube - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1562-PK8', 'Aluminum cubes that allow users to quickly create square assemblies using REV 15mm Extrusion. The cubes are machined from aluminum and feature holes sized to accept standard M3 hardware. 2 pieces of extrusion can be used to create flat assemblies, 3 pieces of extrusion can be used to create 3D corners. Specifications Material: 6061-T6 Aluminum, clear anodized Dimensions: 15mm x 15mm x 15mm Holes: M3 Clearance CAD & Drawings REV-41-1562 STEP File REV-41-1562 Onshape REV-41-1562 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1562/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/345/images/1193/15mm_Corner_Cubes___20455.1613071954.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1563-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1563-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1564-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1564-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Bent Bare Motor Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1566-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1566-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Flat Bare Motor Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1567-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1567-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 120mm - 90° Ends - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1568-PK2', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1568-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 1m - 90° Ends - Black Anodized', 'REV-41-1569', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1569', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm x 30mm Extrusion - 1m - 90° Ends - Black Anodized', 'REV-41-1586', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1586', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('15mm x 30mm Extrusion - 420mm - 90° Ends - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1587-PK4', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1587-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Cartridge - 3:1', 'REV-41-1601', 'This 3:1 cartridge is a pre-assembled, lubricated stage for the UltraPlanetary System. The UltraPlanetary System is a cartridge based modular gearbox designed to handle the rigors of the competition and the classroom. Building on the ability to iterate and adjust designs easily using the DUO Build System, the UltraPlanetary System consists of pre-assembled and lubricated cartridges allowing for swapping gear ratios on the fly and with ease. Users can configure a single-stage planetary using…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1601/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/480/images/1339/UltraPlanetary_Cartridge_Laying_Down__37922.1618525009.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Cartridge - 4:1', 'REV-41-1602', 'This 4:1 cartridge is a pre-assembled, lubricated stage for the UltraPlanetary System. The UltraPlanetary System is a cartridge based modular gearbox designed to handle the rigors of the competition and the classroom. Building on the ability to iterate and adjust designs easily using the DUO Build System, the UltraPlanetary System consists of pre-assembled and lubricated cartridges allowing for swapping gear ratios on the fly and with ease. Users can configure a single-stage planetary using…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1602/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/481/images/1342/UltraPlanetary_Cartridge_Laying_Down__58665.1565907803.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Cartridge - 5:1', 'REV-41-1603', 'This 5:1 cartridge is a pre-assembled, lubricated stage for the UltraPlanetary System. The UltraPlanetary System is a cartridge based modular gearbox designed to handle the rigors of the competition and the classroom. Building on the ability to iterate and adjust designs easily using the DUO Build System, the UltraPlanetary System consists of pre-assembled and lubricated cartridges allowing for swapping gear ratios on the fly and with ease. Users can configure a single-stage planetary using…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1603/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/482/images/1345/UltraPlanetary_Cartridge_Laying_Down__17448.1613072762.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary 550 Motor Plate', 'REV-41-1607', 'The UltraPlanetary 550 Motor Plate works with the REV HD Hex Motor, REV NEO 550 Brushless Motor, and other 550 class motors. The UltraPlanetary System offers a variety of mounting options, with four different brackets available for attachment to REV 15mm Extrusion, C Channel, or U Channel. It is designed for use with the HD Hex Motor (REV-41-1291), NEO 550 Brushless Motor (REV-21-1651), and other 550 series motors that feature compatible shafts and mounting patterns. Specifications Module:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1607/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/516/images/1739/UltraPlanetary_550_Motor_Plate-FINAL-01__39064.1613072743.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('550 Motor Pinions', 'REV-41-1608-PK2', 'The 550 Motor Pinions are used for transferring power from a 550 class motor, like the HD Hex Motor or NEO 550, to a mechanism. These pinions come in four different types. The 32DP pinion gear is compatible with 32DP gears,the UltraPlanetary Pinion is used with UltraPlanetary Gearbox System, the GT2 3mm Pinion is used with GT2 timing belts, and the Helical 550 Motor Pinion with 12 teeth is used exclusively with 20:1 and 40:1 Hex gearboxes ONLY (REV-41-1064 and REV-41-1065 respectively). The…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/550-motor-pinions/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/577/images/2295/REV-21-1908-REV-41-1660-REV-41-1608-550MotorPinions-Hero-FINAL__39131.1633702747.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Hardware Pack', 'REV-41-1609', 'This is all of the hardware included in the UltraPlanetary Gearbox Kit & HD Hex Motor (REV-41-1600) Kit Contents QTY 6 - M3x40mm QTY 6 - M3x30mm QTY 6 - M3x20mm QTY 6 - M3x10mm QTY 2 - M3x8mm Button head QTY 2 - M3x6mm Set Screw Documentation REV-41-1600 User''s Manual CAD & Drawings REV-41-1609 STEP File REV-41-1609 Onshape SKU-DR', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1609/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/483/images/3618/REV-41-1609_UltraPlanetaryHardware_FINAL__15583.1763138702.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Female 5mm Hex Output V2', 'REV-41-1615', 'The UltraPlanetary Female 5mm Output V2 is the output stage of the UltraPlanetary System. With two different ways to transfer power, the output stage allows designers to choose the option best suited for the application. The V2 version of the UltraPlanetary Female 5mm Output offers more flexibility for custom designs by making modifications to the output block. The REV DUO Motion Pattern, combined with the ball bearing supports, allows for directly attaching sprockets, gears, pulleys,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1615/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/591/images/2053/REV-41-1615-UltraPlanetary-Female-5mm-Hex-Output-V2-Side-FINAL__04950.1620332336.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary 1/2in Hex Adapter', 'REV-41-1620', 'The UltraPlanetary 1/2in Hex Adapter is designed to face mount to the UltraPlanetary gearbox and provide a convenient 1/2in hex output shaft that is commonly used in the FIRST Robotics Competition. The recommended hardware for mounting the UltraPlanetary 1/2in Hex Adapter to the UltraPlanetary Female 5mm Hex Output Cartridge would be M3x8mm Socket Cap screws, although any M3x8mm hardware can be used. Specifications Material: 7075 Aluminum Hex Size: 1/2in (flat to flat) Compatible with both…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1620/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/568/images/1965/UltraPlanetary_Hex_Adapter-REV-41-1620-FINAL-01__79894.1616012970.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Outside Mounting Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1621-PK4', 'UltraPlanetary Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The UltraPlanetary Outside Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1621) is used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV U Channel. The UltraPlanetary Bent Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1623), UltraPlanetary Flat Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1624), and UltraPlanetary Long Reach Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1625) are used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraPlanetary-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1621-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/713/images/2901/REV-41-0000-UltraPlanetaryBrackets-Hero-FINAL__26867.1654613474.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Bent Mounting Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1623-PK4', 'UltraPlanetary Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The UltraPlanetary Outside Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1621) is used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV U Channel. The UltraPlanetary Bent Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1623), UltraPlanetary Flat Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1624), and UltraPlanetary Long Reach Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1625) are used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraPlanetary-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1623-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/713/images/2901/REV-41-0000-UltraPlanetaryBrackets-Hero-FINAL__26867.1654613474.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Flat Mounting Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1624-PK4', 'UltraPlanetary Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The UltraPlanetary Outside Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1621) is used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV U Channel. The UltraPlanetary Bent Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1623), UltraPlanetary Flat Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1624), and UltraPlanetary Long Reach Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1625) are used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraPlanetary-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1624-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/713/images/2901/REV-41-0000-UltraPlanetaryBrackets-Hero-FINAL__26867.1654613474.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('UltraPlanetary Long Reach Mounting Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1625-PK2', 'UltraPlanetary Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The UltraPlanetary Outside Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1621) is used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV U Channel. The UltraPlanetary Bent Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1623), UltraPlanetary Flat Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1624), and UltraPlanetary Long Reach Mounting Bracket (REV-41-1625) are used to mount UltraPlanetary Gearboxes to REV…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraPlanetary-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1625-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/713/images/2901/REV-41-0000-UltraPlanetaryBrackets-Hero-FINAL__26867.1654613474.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Slim Shaft Collar - 10 Pack', 'REV-41-1629-PK10', 'The shaft collar (REV-41-1327) is compatible with the DUO Build System and is used to prevent gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts from sliding out of place on a 5mm hex shaft. Shaft collars can also be used to prevent the shaft itself from sliding out of its mounts. Once in place, the set screw is tightened on one(8) of the flat sides of the hex shaft. 1.5mm Allen Wrench for use with set screws sold separately. The REV Robotics Slim Shaft Collar (REV-41-1629) is used to prevent gears,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/shaft-collars?sku=REV-41-1629-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/977/images/3883/REV-41-1327-1629_ShaftCollarFamily_FINAL_v1__46328.1791304665.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Red', 'REV-41-1633', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1633', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — White', 'REV-41-1634', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1634', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Blue', 'REV-41-1635', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1635', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Yellow', 'REV-41-1636', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1636', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Green', 'REV-41-1637', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1637', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Black', 'REV-41-1638', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1638', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion Slot Cover - 2m — Orange', 'REV-41-1639', 'These plastic 15mm Extrusion Slot Covers are ideal for making any machine look great! COLOR SKU Red REV-41-1633 White REV-41-1634 Blue REV-41-1635 Yellow REV-41-1636 Green REV-41-1637 Black REV-41-1638 Orange REV-41-1639 Specifications Material: Flexible PVC Length: 2m', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusion-slot-cover/?sku=REV-41-1639', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/504/images/1388/15mm_Extrusion_Slot_Lifted_No_Colors__46166.1565909795.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
  ('HD Hex Spur Gearbox Spacer V2 - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1648-PK2', 'The HD Hex Planetary Gearbox Spacer (REV-41-1667-PK2) makes it easier to use the Motion Pattern for mounting HD Hex Motors with a Planetary Gearbox. The HD Hex Spur Gearbox Spacer V2 (REV-41-1648-PK2) makes it easier to use the Motion Pattern for mounting HD Hex Motors with a Spur Gearbox. Specifications Material: ABS Documentation DUO Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-41-1667 STEP File REV-41-1667 Onshape REV-41-1667 Drawing REV-41-1648 STEP File REV-41-1648 Onshape REV-41-1648 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/HD-Hex-Spacers?sku=REV-41-1648-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/400/images/3785/REV-41-1648-1667_HDHEXSpacers_FAMILY_FINAL__82930.1778188429.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Actuators / HD Hex Motor', 'rev'),
  ('70 Tooth Metal Gear', 'REV-41-1662', 'Metal gears designed to work with REV 5mm hex shafts in high-load applications. REV metal gears are NOT compatible with REV plastic gears. All REV metal gears are narrower than plastic gears, allowing for compact drivetrains and gearboxes within the same 15mm width as our extrusion and punch tube. 6 different gear sizes available for a wide range of options. Specifications Module: 0.8 Pressure Angle: 20° Material: 7075-T6 Aluminum Thickness: 5mm Hole Diameter: M3 Clearance Hole Spacing: 8mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1662/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/356/images/1195/70T__24263.1533945669.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('42 Tooth Metal Gear', 'REV-41-1664', 'Metal gears designed to work with REV 5mm hex shafts in high-load applications. REV metal gears are NOT compatible with REV plastic gears. All REV metal gears are narrower than plastic gears, allowing for compact drivetrains and gearboxes within the same 15mm width as our extrusion and punch tube. 6 different gear sizes available for a wide range of options. Specifications Module: 0.8 Pressure Angle: 20° Material: 7075-T6 Aluminum Thickness: 5mm Hole Diameter: M3 Clearance Hole Spacing: 8mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1664/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/354/images/1197/42T__49365.1533945550.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('28 Tooth Metal Gear - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1665-PK2', '5mm Metal Hex Bore Gears are compatible with the REV DUO System and work with REV 5mm hex shafts in high-load applications. REV metal gears are NOT compatible with REV plastic gears. All REV metal gears are narrower than plastic gears, allowing for compact drivetrains and gearboxes within the same 15mm width as our extrusion and punch tube. 6 different gear sizes available for a wide range of options. Specifications Module: 0.8 Pressure Angle: 20° Material: Sintered Steel Thickness: 5mm Hole…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Metal-Hex-Bore-Gears/?sku=REV-41-1665-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/715/images/2903/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL_1__03190.1654613623.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('12 Tooth Metal Gear - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1666-PK2', '5mm Metal Hex Bore Gears are compatible with the REV DUO System and work with REV 5mm hex shafts in high-load applications. REV metal gears are NOT compatible with REV plastic gears. All REV metal gears are narrower than plastic gears, allowing for compact drivetrains and gearboxes within the same 15mm width as our extrusion and punch tube. 6 different gear sizes available for a wide range of options. Specifications Module: 0.8 Pressure Angle: 20° Material: Sintered Steel Thickness: 5mm Hole…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Metal-Hex-Bore-Gears/?sku=REV-41-1666-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/715/images/2903/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL_1__03190.1654613623.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('HD Hex Planetary Facemount Spacer - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1667-PK2', 'The HD Hex Planetary Gearbox Spacer (REV-41-1667-PK2) makes it easier to use the Motion Pattern for mounting HD Hex Motors with a Planetary Gearbox. The HD Hex Spur Gearbox Spacer V2 (REV-41-1648-PK2) makes it easier to use the Motion Pattern for mounting HD Hex Motors with a Spur Gearbox. Specifications Material: ABS Documentation DUO Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-41-1667 STEP File REV-41-1667 Onshape REV-41-1667 Drawing REV-41-1648 STEP File REV-41-1648 Onshape REV-41-1648 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/HD-Hex-Spacers?sku=REV-41-1667-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/400/images/3785/REV-41-1648-1667_HDHEXSpacers_FAMILY_FINAL__82930.1778188429.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Actuators / HD Hex Motor', 'rev'),
  ('12 Tooth GT2 3mm Pitch Pulley - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1668-PK4', 'Timing belts and pulleys are compatible with the REV DUO System. They are lighter and can be more efficient than chains and sprockets. Tensioning and adjustment are a thing of the past. 24 Tooth through 60 Tooth size pulleys come with two ends and an insert to adjust the width of the pulley to drive multiple belts. Use these pulleys with GT2 timing belts. Specifications Material: POM Documentation Timing Belt and Pulley Basics Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1668 12…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/GT2-3mm-Pitch-Pulleys/?sku=REV-41-1668-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/706/images/2907/REV-41-0000-GT2PulleySystem-Hero-FINAL__67825.1654809615.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Inside Channel Servo Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1681-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1681-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Metal Outside Channel Servo Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1682-PK4', '15mm Metal Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes holes on an 8mm grid that is compatible with many other building systems. The 15mm Metal Bent Core Hex Motor Bracket V2 (REV-41-1433) is used to mount the Core Hex Motor to 15mm Extrusion inline with other low-profile motion components. The 15mm Metal Bent Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1563) and 15mm Metal Flat Planetary Motor Bracket (REV-41-1564) are used to mount HD Hex Motors with planetary gearboxes to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Metal-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1682-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/711/images/2899/REV-41-0000-15mmMetalMotionBrackets-Hero-final__04816.1654613290.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('5mm Hex Bearing Block', 'REV-41-1683', 'This metal Hex Bearing Block is used with the REV DUO 15mm Extrusion and REV DUO Channel. A hex ball bearing is pre-pressed into the metal bracket. Specifications Material: Sintered Steel, Steel CAD & Drawings SKU-STP REV-41-1683 Onshape SKU-DR', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1683/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/467/images/1499/5mm_Hex_Bearing_Block_Side_Hero__99071.1614450895.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('U Channel Endcap - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1687-PK4', 'The U Channel Endcap spans between the two sides of U Channel to provide holes on multiple surfaces to fasten additional components to. Also, using the endcap is a great way to strengthen longer sections of U Channel that are experiencing high loads. Specifications Material: 6063 Aluminum CAD & Drawings REV-41-1687 STEP File REV-41-1687 Onshape REV-41-1687 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1687/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/452/images/2184/REV-41-1687-UchannelEndCap-45DegreesFlat-FINAL__40212.1632940083.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
