  ('Tensioning Bushing - 39mm - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1702-PK4', 'When designing chain or belt driven system, the ability to adjust tension in the system is ideal. Using the Tensioning Bushing with REV DUO U Channel allows users to fine tune their system to find the optimum amount of tension for any application. Specifications Material: Nylon PA6 Length: 39mm CAD & Drawings REV-41-1702 STEP File REV-41-1702 Onshape REV-41-1702 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1702/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/405/images/1472/Tensioning-Bushing-REV-41-1702__87580.1615481443.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('L Beam - 504mm - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1703-PK2', 'DUO L Beams are compatible with the REV DUO System and are a structural element for small load applications or as a supporting component on a larger load application. They are compact, lightweight, and provide more strength than a flat beam. Use them to create a corner between plates, attach channel to extrusion, or for fastening your own creations. Specifications Material: 6063-T6 Aluminum Width: 11.5mm Height: 11.5mm Thickness: 3mm Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-L-Beams/?sku=REV-41-1703-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/705/images/2855/REV-41-0000-L_Beam-Hero-FINAL__69064.1652970646.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Structure / Channel', 'rev'),
